  "description": "<p>This mod adds a new trader that sells all food &amp; drink items.</p>\n<p>The prices are <strong>100% Base Price</strong> from handbook.</p>\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n<hr />\n<ol>\n<li>Open the downloaded zip file</li>\n<li>Select the <code>SPT</code> folder in the zip file</li>\n<li>Drag the <code>SPT</code> folder from zip file into your <code>Game_folder</code></li>\n</ol>\n<hr />\n<h2>Recommended Mods</h2>\n<hr />\n<p>Please use Kaeno-TraderScrolling for more ease of use, when having multiple custom traders enabled</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1089/kaeno-traderscrolling\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1089/kaeno-traderscrolling</a></p>\n<hr />\n",
